    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35883" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">phăgĕdaenĭcus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαγεδαινικός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>spreading like a cancer</i>, <i>can-cerous</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vulnera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					24, 4, 5, § 9</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, of persons, <i>suffering from cancers</i>, <i>cancerous</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">phagedaenici,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Tard. 3, 3, 47</span></i>
			.</div>
